# SOLITAIRE: SHIFT — OpenAI asset generation pipeline
#
# This file is the ONLY place the key is referenced. Copy it to a real .env
# (which is gitignored) and fill in your key. The real .env must NEVER be
# committed, exposed to the browser, or shipped with the game.
#
# The build-side tool at tools/gen-art/generate.js reads it directly (no deps):
# first from the environment, then from a .env in the project root, then from
# a .env one directory up. The player's game never sees or needs this key.
#
# Where to put the real file: the project root, i.e. "SOLITAIRE SHIFT/.env"

OPENAI_API_KEY=